      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_00_02",
      "hash64": "49EB477ABC04594A",
      "text": "无法参加队伍。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_01_00",
      "hash64": "48AFFB7594F6BCD5",
      "text": "要退出队伍吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_01_01",
      "hash64": "48AFFA7594F6BB22",
      "text": "已退出队伍！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_01_02",
      "hash64": "48AFF97594F6B96F",
      "text": "要和这些成员一起出发吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_02_00",
      "hash64": "7719798DA1EC3CC2",
      "text": "要解散队伍吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_03_00",
      "hash64": "1F6D2F86056CE033",
      "text": "还有成员正在做准备。\\n请稍等片刻再出发吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_con_00_00",
      "hash64": "79E59C9EB0672FA5",
      "text": "是",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_con_00_01",
      "hash64": "79E59B9EB0672DF2",
      "text": "否",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_01",
      "hash64": "4B3DD23D885F6D3A",
      "text": "欢迎光～临！\\n要不要玩打鬼祭啊？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_02",
      "hash64": "4B3DD13D885F6B87",
      "text": "你要打个痛快哦！\\n那么，这边请～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_03",
      "hash64": "4B3DD03D885F69D4",
      "text": "还要再来玩哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_04",
      "hash64": "4B3DCF3D885F6821",
      "text": "恭喜你通关了初级！\\n这是首次通关的纪念，你拿去吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_05",
      "hash64": "4B3DCE3D885F666E",
      "text": "对你来说，\\n中级的打鬼祭应该也不成问题吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_06",
      "hash64": "4B3DCD3D885F64BB",
      "text": "恭喜你通关了中级！\\n这是首次通关的纪念，你拿去吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_07",
      "hash64": "4B3DCC3D885F6308",
      "text": "对你来说，\\n高级的打鬼祭应该也不成问题吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08",
      "hash64": "4B3DCB3D885F6155",
      "text": "恭喜你通关了高级！\\n这么好的成绩可是难得一见哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_2",
      "hash64": "925FF7862C6613A4",
      "text": "我或许可以\\n把那只宝可梦托付给你……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_3",
      "hash64": "925FF8862C661557",
      "text": "每次举办打鬼祭的时候，\\n都会吸引来一只\\r\\n贪吃的小卡比兽。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_4",
      "hash64": "925FF5862C66103E",
      "text": "它太贪吃了，每次一来\\n都会让打鬼祭的难度变得更高……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_5",
      "hash64": "925FF6862C6611F1",
      "text": "……因此！\\n那只小卡比兽就托付给你吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_6",
      "hash64": "925FF3862C660CD8",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]收到了\\n大姐姐托付的小卡比兽！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_09",
      "hash64": "4B3DCA3D885F5FA2",
      "text": "……哎呀！\\n你的盒子满了啊。\\r\\n等你整理好之后再来吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_10",
      "hash64": "4B3A4D3D885C5564",
      "text": "我要玩",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_11",
      "hash64": "4B3A4E3D885C5717",
      "text": "之前说的小卡比兽！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_12",
      "hash64": "4B3A4F3D885C58CA",
      "text": "之前说的小卡比兽！\\n这次真的要托付给你咯！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_07_00",
      "hash64": "8C3E6161FE840771",
      "text": "请输入密语。",
      "flags": 0,
